  "faithful": "1. This triple falt is formed, either by the direct combination of the solutions of nitrate of ammonia, and nitrate of magnesia, by which the falt is obtained pure and cryftallized ; or, by partially decomposing the nitrate of ammonia by magnesia, or the nitrate of magnesia by ammonia.",
  "modern": "1. This triple salt is formed, either by the direct combination of the solutions of nitrate of ammonia, and nitrate of magnesia, by which the salt is obtained pure and crystallized; or, by partially decomposing the nitrate of ammonia by magnesia, or the nitrate of magnesia by ammonia."
